    "evidence": "The headline, instruction, prominent LAUNCH EVENT button, and side-by-side ALLOW/BLOCK result make the core interaction understandable across viewports. However, “change one” is unsupported by any baseline or changed-state marker; results appear already populated, so it is unclear whether they precede or follow launch; and “Risk reduced” conflicts with the displayed 100/100 fused risk without explanation. On mobile, the global header does not expose Composer or a clear current-location indicator.",
